+
+`tests/run-xam-bootanim-dispatch-smoke.sh`, `tests/run-xam-entry-smoke.sh`, `tests/run-stack-smoke.sh`, and `tests/run-bootanim-preview-smoke.sh` pass.
+
+## Explicit limitation: bootanim guest code
+
+The module's XEX entry point and PE `AddressOfEntryPoint` are both `0`. Its PE export directory contains no exported function. The `.XBMOVIE` section has a 12-byte virtual size and is zero-filled. There is no supported guest entrypoint to invoke. The implementation deliberately does not jump to an arbitrary `.text` function or fabricate an entry address.
+
+Therefore, the verified result is **XAM import dispatch + AniStartBootAnimation service acceptance + bootanim image registration**, not execution of bootanim's internal guest `.text` and not retail animation playback. The service currently initializes modeled display state only. Xenos PM4 command processing/draw execution remains absent, and the framebuffer remains black.
